  "description": "A classic of the Counter-Strike series, the edge of this knife is press-fit Stellite perfectly held in place due to its precise fit with the titanium on the blade's cheek and spine. The handle is fossilized mastodon ivory held in a carbon fibre pocket. It has been spray-painted using a tangle of masking tape as a stencil.\\n\\n<i>True power is demonstrated with subtle application</i>",
